{
  "repo": "HYDRA-UMC-BRIDGE-CNC",
  "ecosystem": "hydra",
  "tagline": "A fail-safe snapshot of a CNC cell: the controller reports, the shared gate decides.",
  "description": "HYDRA-UMC-BRIDGE-CNC reads the state of a CNC controller (GRBL, LinuxCNC or CNCjs) and the E-STOP and door of the cell, turns it into a cell snapshot and passes every job through the shared evaluate_job gate of HYDRA-UMC-SDK; the answers go out over MQTT. The controller keeps trajectory, spindle and limit authority.",
